 "text": "Paid on the 14th. Remittance attached. It wasn't. Nothing attached? Reattached. That's matches. Which account? Can we jump on a call? Both correct according to themselves. So on QSME, the subcontractor puts proof and invoice on the stage, not in an inbox. Only the payer can mark it paid, and the screen's honest about it. This goes on your word. And the remittance? Actually attached. Only the receiver can confirm it once the money's landed. Don't confirm on a promise because QSME never touches the money. It keeps the one record you both ticked. Book a thirty-minute demo at qsme.build, the one call worth jumping on.",
